      },
      "message": "[feat]: Add new skills, commands, and remote environment setup\n\nAdd project-init skill for configuring Claude Code projects with\nSessionStart hooks that pull user configuration in sandboxed environments.\n\nAdd skill-creator skill with initialization scripts and reference\ndocumentation for creating effective Claude skills.\n\nAdd systematic-debugger skill for applying Fagan Inspection methodology\nto persistent bugs.\n\nAdd permission-analyzer skill for analyzing Claude Code permissions.\n\nAdd starwave commands (design, requirements, tasks) and make-it-so command.\n\nAdd claude-remote.sh script for remote environment configuration.\n\nUpdate Swift language rules, simplify creating-spec and rune skills.",
