      "tree": {
        "sha": "cc277fccee089889a7effd5660f37c641d7d953f",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ArjenSchwarz/agentic-coding/git/trees/cc277fccee089889a7effd5660f37c641d7d953f"
      },
      "message": "[feat]: Add language detection to project-init skill\n\nEnhance project-init skill to automatically detect project languages\nand add appropriate tool permissions to settings.json.\n\nDetects languages based on marker files (go.mod, package.json,\nCargo.toml, etc.) and adds corresponding toolchain permissions.\n\nSupports Go, Swift, Node.js, Python, Rust, Ruby, Java (Maven/Gradle),\nDocker, and Terraform. Always includes git permissions.\n\nPermissions are merged without duplicating existing entries.",
      "parents": [
        {
          "sha": "2d319c3efa8983219fc4009534ac96d963ca99d0",
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ArjenSchwarz/agentic-coding/git/commits/2d319c3efa8983219fc4009534ac96d963ca99d0",
          "html_url": "https://github.com/ArjenSchwarz/agentic-coding/commit/2d319c3efa8983219fc4009534ac96d963ca99d0"
        }
      ],
